{"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/oudsthemesorange\/orangethemeskeletoncomponenttokensprovider\/colors"]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange","doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeSkeletonComponentTokensProvider"]]},"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"kind":"symbol","identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeSkeletonComponentTokensProvider\/colors"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Provider of color semantic tokens to use for link colors"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"colors"},{"kind":"text","text":": any "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/documentation\/OUDSThemesContract\/AllColorSemanticTokensProvider","text":"AllColorSemanticTokensProvider","preciseIdentifier":"s:18OUDSThemesContract30AllColorSemanticTokensProviderP"}],"platforms":["macOS"]}],"kind":"declarations"}],"metadata":{"role":"symbol","title":"colors","roleHeading":"Instance Property","modules":[{"name":"Theme Orange"}],"symbolKind":"property","externalID":"s:16OUDSThemesOrange0B36ThemeSkeletonComponentTokensProviderC6colors0A8Contract016AllColorSemanticfG0_pvp","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"colors"},{"kind":"text","text":": any "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"AllColorSemanticTokensProvider","preciseIdentifier":"s:18OUDSThemesContract30AllColorSemanticTokensProviderP"}]},"sections":[],"references":{"doc://OUDSThemesContract/documentation/OUDSThemesContract/AllColorSemanticTokensProvider":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/documentation\/OUDSThemesContract\/AllColorSemanticTokensProvider","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/oudsthemescontract\/allcolorsemantictokensprovider","fragments":[{"text":"protocol","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"AllColorSemanticTokensProvider","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"AllColorSemanticTokensProvider","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","title":"AllColorSemanticTokensProvider","abstract":[{"text":"Something which provides all semantic tokens of colors","type":"text"}],"role":"symbol"},"ic_theme_orange.png":{"type":"image","variants":[{"traits":["1x","light"],"url":"\/images\/OUDSThemesOrange\/ic_theme_orange.png"}],"identifier":"ic_theme_orange.png","alt":null},"doc://OUDSThemesOrange/documentation/OUDSThemesOrange/OrangeThemeSkeletonComponentTokensProvider":{"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"OrangeThemeSkeletonComponentTokensProvider"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A class which wraps all "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"component  tokens of skeleton"}]},{"type":"text","text":" for "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"skeleton"}]},{"text":" objects like ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSSkeleton"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Contains also references to semantic tokens providers so as to be able to use them to define the component tokens."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"This provider should be integrated as a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AllSkeletonComponentTokensProvider"},{"type":"text","text":" implementation inside "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSTheme"},{"type":"text","text":" so as to provide"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"all tokens to the users. It helps users to override some of the tokens and assign them to an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSTheme"},{"type":"text","text":" implementation to use."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Custom themes can use subclass of "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeSkeletonComponentTokensProvider"},{"type":"text","text":" and apply the provider they need."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"It implements also the protocol "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SkeletonComponentTokens"},{"type":"text","text":" so as to expose the component tokens for "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"skeleton","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" through any "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSTheme"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"Skeleton","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" components tokens are defined with semantic tokens of colors (from "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AllColorSemanticTokensProvider"},{"type":"text","text":")."}],"url":"\/documentation\/oudsthemesorange\/orangethemeskeletoncomponenttokensprovider","title":"OrangeThemeSkeletonComponentTokensProvider","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"OrangeThemeSkeletonComponentTokensProvider"}],"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeSkeletonComponentTokensProvider"},"doc://OUDSThemesOrange/documentation/OUDSThemesOrange/OrangeThemeSkeletonComponentTokensProvider/colors":{"url":"\/documentation\/oudsthemesorange\/orangethemeskeletoncomponenttokensprovider\/colors","title":"colors","role":"symbol","type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"Provider of color semantic tokens to use for link colors","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeSkeletonComponentTokensProvider\/colors","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"colors"},{"kind":"text","text":": any "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:18OUDSThemesContract30AllColorSemanticTokens